id: reserved-mark
name: Reserved
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Reserved Combatant (3)'s - the Holding Back Maneuver's effects ignored for one Maneuver, its stacks
# still held (maneuvers/holding-back.dbu).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Reserved Combatant: the effects of your Holding Back stacks ignored for the duration of this Maneuver - the stacks still held.
text: >
  Reserved Combatant (3): When you use an Attacking Maneuver, a Unique Ability, or are targeted by an Attacking Maneuver/Unique Ability, you can ignore your stacks of Holding Back for the duration of that Maneuver.

---
